SUMMARY:I Think I'm Turning Japanese (I Really Think So\, Not!)
LOCATION:Just the Tonic at The Caves\, 253 Cowgate\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Blending British wit with Japanese sensibility\, Sam Joseph's s
 tand-up show explores life between cultures. After six years living in Japa
 n and 20 years raising bilingual children with his Japanese wife across Tok
 yo\, Honolulu and the UK\, he unpacks the joys and absurdities of internati
 onal family life. Expect sharp observations on language mishaps\, cultural 
 misunderstandings and the strange things that happen when British understat
 ement meets Japanese politeness. Following his previous fringe show Comedy 
 Booby Trap\, performed at Leicester\, Brighton and Tunbridge Wells Fringes.
